ary\r\n\r\nThis PR adds support for reloading TLS certificates when headscale receives a SIGHUP signal, enabling zero-downtime certificate rotation for deployments using manual TLS configuration.\r\n\r\n## Changes\r\n- TLS certificate reload on SIGHUP: When headscale receives SIGHUP, it now reloads TLS certificates from disk\r\n  (in addition to existing ACL policy reload)\r\n- Thread-safe certificate access: Uses sync.RWMutex to protect certificate access during concurrent requests and\r\n   reloads\r\n- Dynamic certificate serving: Switched from static Certificates slice to GetCertificate callback for runtime\r\n  certificate updates\r\n\r\n## Tasks\r\n- [x] have read the [CONTRIBUTING.md](./CONTRIBUTING.md) file\r\n- [x] raised a GitHub issue or discussed it on the projects chat beforehand\r\n- [x] added unit tests\r\n- [x] added integration tests\r\n- [x] updated documentation if needed\r\n- [x] updated CHANGELOG.md\r\n\r\n<!-- If applicable, please reference the issue using `Fixes #XXX` and add tests to cover your new code. -->\r\nFixes #3027 \r\n\r\nDisclaimer: This PR is implemented full auto by Claude Code and reviewed by me.","created_at":"2026-01-24T21:21:48Z","updated_at":"2026-02-23T16:59:27Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/orgs","repos_url":"https://